#ASSERT `Chapter 9 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Gil" `born` (YMD 1959 3 1) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 2 28)
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 9 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Gil" `born` (YMD 1959 3 1) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
-- A man born 15 January 2008 turns 18 on 15 January 2026.
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 6 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Teen" `born` (YMD 2008 1 15) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 14)
#ASSERT `Chapter 6 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Teen" `born` (YMD 2008 1 15) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 9 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Teen" `born` (YMD 2008 1 15) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 14)
#ASSERT `Chapter 9 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Teen" `born` (YMD 2008 1 15) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- A man born 15 July 1950 reached 804 months on 15 July 2017: not insured under 6 and 9.
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 6 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Dov" `born` (YMD 1950 7 15) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 9 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Dov" `born` (YMD 1950 7 15) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- A woman born 10 December 1955: 744 months, reached 10 December 2017.
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 6 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Edna" `born` (YMD 1955 12 10) `who is` `female`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- A woman born 10 May 1964: the Retirement Age Law's Part B, 1964: 63 and 6 months = 762 months, reached 10 November 2027.
#ASSERT `Chapter 6 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Hila" `born` (YMD 1964 5 10) `who is` `female`) `on` (YMD 2027 11 9)
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 6 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Hila" `born` (YMD 1964 5 10) `who is` `female`) `on` (YMD 2027 11 10)
-- A woman born 15 January 1966: Part B, 1966: 64 years = 768 months, reached 15 January 2030.
#ASSERT `Chapter 6 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Yael" `born` (YMD 1966 1 15) `who is` `female`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT `Chapter 6 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Yael" `born` (YMD 1966 1 15) `who is` `female`) `on` (YMD 2030 1 14)
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 6 for` (`an Israeli employee` "Yael" `born` (YMD 1966 1 15) `who is` `female`) `on` (YMD 2030 1 15)
-- A non-resident (a visitor on a B visa) is not insured under Chapter 6, 9 or 11.
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 6 for` (`a man living in Israel under` `a visitor's visa and licence of type B/1, B/2, B/3 or B/4, under regulation 5 of the Entry Regulations`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)

§ `Tests — Chapter 7 (s 158) and s 6B`

-- (1): an employee entitled to wages for which the employer must pay contributions, not a kibbutz member
-- regarded as a worker, a resident or a temporary resident of 18 or over below the Part B age.
#ASSERT `section 158(1) for` avi `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT NOT `section 158(1) for` (`a person` "Nowage" `born` (YMD 1988 3 10) `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1988 3 10)) `and` (`the work of an employee in Israel, controlling` FALSE `, kibbutz member` FALSE `, entitled to wages` FALSE `, police type` FALSE `, insured earlier` FALSE)) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT NOT `section 158(1) for` (`a person` "Kib" `born` (YMD 1988 3 10) `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1988 3 10)) `and` (`the work of an employee in Israel, controlling` FALSE `, kibbutz member` TRUE `, entitled to wages` TRUE `, police type` FALSE `, insured earlier` FALSE)) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- Part B: a man born 1 March 1959 reaches 804 months on 1 March 2026.
#ASSERT `section 158(1) for` (`an Israeli employee` "Gil" `born` (YMD 1959 3 1) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 2 28)
#ASSERT NOT `section 158(1) for` (`an Israeli employee` "Gil" `born` (YMD 1959 3 1) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
-- 18: born 15 January 2008.
#ASSERT NOT `section 158(1) for` (`an Israeli employee` "Teen" `born` (YMD 2008 1 15) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 14)
#ASSERT `section 158(1) for` (`an Israeli employee` "Teen" `born` (YMD 2008 1 15) `who is` `male`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- A temporary resident: the Law does not define the term (fork R2); the case says so, and the residence test
-- is not applied. A visitor on a B visa who is recorded as a temporary resident is insured under (1).
#ASSERT `section 158(1) for` (`a person` "Temp" `born` (YMD 1988 3 10) `who is` `male` `with` (`The residence facts of a person` WITH `lives in Israel` IS TRUE, `permission to stay` IS `a visitor's visa and licence of type B/1, B/2, B/3 or B/4, under regulation 5 of the Entry Regulations`, `absent from Israel beyond a reasonable temporary absence` IS FALSE, `the day the person first became an Israeli resident` IS NOTHING, `a temporary resident` IS TRUE) `and` `the work of an employee in Israel`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- The same visitor not recorded as a temporary resident is not a resident, so not insured under (1).
#ASSERT NOT `section 158(1) for` (`a man living in Israel under` `a visitor's visa and licence of type B/1, B/2, B/3 or B/4, under regulation 5 of the Entry Regulations`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- s 6B: a controlling shareholder is insured under (1) as the paragraph reads, but Chapters 7 and 8 do not
-- apply to him.
#ASSERT `section 158(1) for` (`a person` "Boss" `born` (YMD 1988 3 10) `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1988 3 10)) `and` (`the work of an employee in Israel, controlling` TRUE `, kibbutz member` FALSE `, entitled to wages` TRUE `, police type` FALSE `, insured earlier` FALSE)) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 7 for` (`a person` "Boss" `born` (YMD 1988 3 10) `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1988 3 10)) `and` (`the work of an employee in Israel, controlling` TRUE `, kibbutz member` FALSE `, entitled to wages` TRUE `, police type` FALSE `, insured earlier` FALSE)) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 8 for` (`a person` "Boss" `born` (YMD 1988 3 10) `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1988 3 10)) `and` (`the work of an employee in Israel, controlling` TRUE `, kibbutz member` FALSE `, entitled to wages` TRUE `, police type` FALSE `, insured earlier` FALSE)) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT `s 6B — Chapters 7 and 8 do not apply to the person:` (`a person` "Boss" `born` (YMD 1988 3 10) `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1988 3 10)) `and` (`the work of an employee in Israel, controlling` TRUE `, kibbutz member` FALSE `, entitled to wages` TRUE `, police type` FALSE `, insured earlier` FALSE))

§§ `(2) a released soldier; (3) a completed national or community service`

-- (2): from the day of release and for one year from that day: released 1 December 2025.
#ASSERT NOT `s 158 — insured under paragraph (2), a soldier released from regular service:` (batya `released from regular service on` (YMD 2025 12 1)) `on` (YMD 2025 11 30)
#ASSERT `s 158 — insured under paragraph (2), a soldier released from regular service:` (batya `released from regular service on` (YMD 2025 12 1)) `on` (YMD 2025 12 1)
#ASSERT `s 158 — insured under paragraph (2), a soldier released from regular service:` (batya `released from regular service on` (YMD 2025 12 1)) `on` (YMD 2026 11 30)
#ASSERT NOT `s 158 — insured under paragraph (2), a soldier released from regular service:` (batya `released from regular service on` (YMD 2025 12 1)) `on` (YMD 2026 12 1)
#ASSERT NOT `s 158 — insured under paragraph (2), a soldier released from regular service:` batya `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- (3), the temporary provision (a service begun before 31 August 2026): 24 months or more, one year from the
-- end of the service, which ended 31 January 2026.
#ASSERT `s 158 — insured under paragraph (3), a completed national or community service:` (batya `with the completed service` (`a service of` 24 `months ended` (YMD 2026 1 31) `, civil-national:` FALSE `, began before 31 August 2026:` TRUE `, woman married within 30 days:` FALSE)) `on` (YMD 2027 1 30)
#ASSERT NOT `s 158 — insured under paragraph (3), a completed national or community service:` (batya `with the completed service` (`a service of` 24 `months ended` (YMD 2026 1 31) `, civil-national:` FALSE `, began before 31 August 2026:` TRUE `, woman married within 30 days:` FALSE)) `on` (YMD 2027 1 31)
#ASSERT NOT `s 158 — insured under paragraph (3), a completed national or community service:` (batya `with the completed service` (`a service of` 24 `months ended` (YMD 2026 1 31) `, civil-national:` FALSE `, began before 31 August 2026:` TRUE `, woman married within 30 days:` FALSE)) `on` (YMD 2026 1 30)
#ASSERT NOT `s 158 — insured under paragraph (3), a completed national or community service:` (batya `with the completed service` (`a service of` 23 `months ended` (YMD 2026 1 31) `, civil-national:` FALSE `, began before 31 August 2026:` TRUE `, woman married within 30 days:` FALSE)) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- The proviso: a woman who served six months or more and married within 30 days of stopping is deemed to have
-- served the full period; the year runs from the day she stopped.
#ASSERT `s 158 — insured under paragraph (3), a completed national or community service:` (batya `with the completed service` (`a service of` 6 `months ended` (YMD 2026 1 31) `, civil-national:` FALSE `, began before 31 August 2026:` TRUE `, woman married within 30 days:` TRUE)) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- A service begun on or after 31 August 2026 is measured against s 16(1) of the Security Service Law, which
-- is not deposited: declined, unless the proviso decides.
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 158 — insured under paragraph (3), a completed national or community service:` (batya `with the completed service` (`a service of` 30 `months ended` (YMD 2026 1 31) `, civil-national:` FALSE `, began before 31 August 2026:` FALSE `, woman married within 30 days:` FALSE)) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT `s 158 — insured under paragraph (3), a completed national or community service:` (batya `with the completed service` (`a service of` 6 `months ended` (YMD 2026 1 31) `, civil-national:` FALSE `, began before 31 August 2026:` FALSE `, woman married within 30 days:` TRUE)) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)

§ `Tests — Chapter 8 (ss 180-181)`

-- A worker: one who is or was insured as an employee under Chapter 5. A former employee (insured earlier)
-- is still within; one who never was is not; a controlling shareholder is out (s 6B).
#ASSERT `Chapter 8 for` avi `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT `Chapter 8 for` (`a person` "Former" `born` (YMD 1988 3 10) `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1988 3 10)) `and` `the work of a former employee`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 8 for` (`a person` "Never" `born` (YMD 1988 3 10) `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1988 3 10)) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)

§ `Tests — Chapter 11 (ss 240, 243)`

-- A man born 1 January 1950: Part C, "May 1947 and after: 62" = 744 months, reached 1 January 2012.
-- He first became an Israeli resident on 1 January 2012 (his 62nd birthday): he had reached it, so he is not
-- insured. One day earlier (31 December 2011) he had not: insured.
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 11 for` (`a person` "Olim" `born` (YMD 1950 1 1) `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 2012 1 1)) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT `Chapter 11 for` (`a person` "Olim" `born` (YMD 1950 1 1) `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 2011 12 31)) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- A woman born 1 January 1950: retirement age "May 1947 to December 1955: 62" = 744 months, reached
-- 1 January 2012. The same two days.
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 11 for` (`a person` "Olah" `born` (YMD 1950 1 1) `who is` `female` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 2012 1 1)) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT `Chapter 11 for` (`a person` "Olah" `born` (YMD 1950 1 1) `who is` `female` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 2011 12 31)) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- The day the person first became a resident is not in the case: declined by name.
#ASSERT REFUSED `Chapter 11 for` (`a person` "Nodate" `born` (YMD 1950 1 1) `who is` `male` `with` (`a person living in Israel under` `no permission that section 2A names`) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- Not a resident, not insured.
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 11 for` (`a person` "Abroad" `born` (YMD 1988 3 10) `who is` `male` `with` `a person living abroad` `and` `the work of an employee in Israel`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
-- Under 18: born 15 January 2008, not insured on 14 January 2026, insured on 15 January 2026.
